Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was in fifth grade, I pointed\Na gun at a man and killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fill it up or you get it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the money now or\NI'm gonna kill her next!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little give it back, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of my gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pulled the trigger three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I saw a gun on TV or\Neven a picture of one,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would trigger my PTSD and\Nsend me into a panic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.95,0:01:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mets didn't help. Counseling didn't help.\NNothing helped me get rid of my phobia.
