Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eyes of my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy with the red\Neyes of my eyes. I'm
