Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought if I got as far\Naway from home as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To this high school in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd get better somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But nothing changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any regrets pulling\Nthat trigger to protect my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.65,0:04:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not strong enough to convince\Nmyself it was the best choice either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite being so screwed up, I\Ndid make one friend in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the one who got me\Ninto playing Gungale online.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyoji Shinkawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've been totally left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the last qualifier, you made it all\Nthe way to the semifinals, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An AGI build only gets you so far in GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good gun helps, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent points on the wrong stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get so down about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sign up for B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, no point. I'd just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tea. And thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could always\Nbe there to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, if you want, I can\Nwalk you home every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way I'll get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the time, I was so focused on\Ntaking care of me and getting better,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice Kyoji's\Ntrue feelings for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In GGO,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I became Xenot, the Sniper,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I made it my mission to\Ntake on the strongest players.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullets are flying, and\Nhe's got the guts to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.19,0:06:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I will, too, when I kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the stronger\NXenon got in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stronger I'd get in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believed it with every fiber in me, so\NI took on all comers with my Hecate II.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the Governor's Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was on my way over to sign up\Nfor the prelims for the third
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullet of Bullets tourney when I\Nmet a player calling herself Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out she was a he and insisted\Non using a sword in a game of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, did he piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a guy with that avatar?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he pissed me off, I could\Ntell he was fighting his own demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't even know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he think he can dodge\Nmy bullet at this range?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he even want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't, don't screw with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you think I'm\Nnot worth the effort!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is to compete in the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then go on and shoot yourself\Nand get it over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To you, it's just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one stupid match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all it is to\Nyou, is that it? A game?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, just because you feel\Nthat way doesn't mean I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon, give me a chance\Nto make it right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me give you the fight I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, get set.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew where I was\Naiming, but how did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know I was going for\Nyour leg I knew because
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.81,0:12:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Could see your eye\Nthrough the lens of your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scope. That's how he\Npredicted my bullet's path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing. That kind of\Npower is way beyond any VR game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're so strong you can do that,\Nwhy'd you look so afraid before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.59,0:12:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it is is a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technique isn't enough to cut a\Nbullet from my Hecate in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I both know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes strength and all I\Nwant to know is how to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I'm here to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could you shoot a player\Nin here if you knew
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.07,0:12:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the real world that\Nplayer would die from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what if you had to kill that player?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if you didn't, you or\Nsomeone you love would die instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had that power, could\Nyou still pull that trigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When death gun drew down on me, all\Nthe hope i'd put into sinon's strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.95,0:13:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I type 54, Black Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he have that gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling that right\Nnow in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun's partner's in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:14:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's watching the live stream, waiting\Nfor when you get shot by that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.29,0:14:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until Death Gun shoots you, The guy in\Nyour place isn't gonna do anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the rule they\Nset up for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.05,0:14:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you log out now and\Nwake up with his partner there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to take out Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.19,0:15:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm weak and I need your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strength to stand up\Nfor myself and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Home in on his drive to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.21,0:16:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:17:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can slow him down, in\None second's all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, Kirito's trying to get\Nthat closure he was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's confronting his demons from SAO by\Ntaking on the person who represents them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.81,0:17:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the reason he can\Nisn't because he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cause he accepts what he did,\Neven though it still tears him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's still trying\Nto move on, despite it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to do something. Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon's distracting him\Nwith her bullet line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got him in her sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using all her skill and spirit\Nto keep it trained on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.91,0:17:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a phantom bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't waste this chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.49,0:18:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Zaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.11,0:19:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll find your partner, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't kill anyone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing Coffin's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Shino.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.39,0:20:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shino Asada.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess now we should probably\Nget this tourney over with, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought once I got to be the\Nstrongest player in Gungale Online,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'd somehow cancel out my\Nweakness in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.35,0:21:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have been more wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Sinon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized Sinon and Shino were the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I won't get better overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a long time before I can
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.05,0:21:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come to grips with the\Nmemory of what I did.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.50,0:21:41.96,loli,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,431)\fscy140\fscx140\blur0.8\fax-0.22\frz349.4\pos(1347,148)\c&H38424C&}Shino-oneesan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, little by\Nlittle, I will get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world isn't that scary anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.77,0:22:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty nice, actually?
